- `b_fold_zs_sum_size` = `add(cs_rank(cross_ema(abs_(cs_bucket_zscore(day_std(Ret), LogFloatCap)), 30)), cs_rank(cross_ema(abs_(cs_bucket_zscore(day_gini(Low), LogFloatCap)), 30)))`  — F107 升级版整条换成同市值档 z 分数折叠(两项排名相加):不死水也不乱跳,而且是相对同样大小的票 —— 拿掉市值之后的「典型性」主对象。预期买低,样本内净超额 +6~+9%、与 a_size 秩相关 |ρ| < 0.15;若 < +3%,典型性折叠的收益是市值。
- `b_fuse5_in_size` = `cs_bucket_rank(add(add(add(add(cs_rank(neg(add(cs_rank(cross_ema(abs_(cs_bucket_zscore(day_std(Ret), LogFloatCap)), 30)), cs_rank(cross_ema(abs_(cs_bucket_zscore(day_gini(Low), LogFloatCap)), 30))))), cs_rank(neg(cs_bucket_demean(cross_mean(day_gini(Ret), 30), LogFloatCap)))), cs_rank(cs_bucket_rank(ts_pearson(day_last(Close), 20), LogFloatCap))), cs_rank(cs_bucket_rank(neg(cross_ema(cross_quantile_q25(day_close(Ret), 60), 30)), LogFloatCap))), cs_rank(cs_bucket_rank(neg(cross_ema(mul(sub(div(day_last(Close), day_first(Open)), 1), abs_(sub(div(day_last(Close), day_first(Open)), 1))), 30)), LogFloatCap))), LogFloatCap)`  — 同上,再加两条市值档内的成分(F114 的尾盘下四分位、F110 的日内反转)。预期比三条的版本夏普高 0.2~0.5;若不升,后两条在档内与前三条是同一个东西。
- `b_f113_nested` = `cs_bucket_rank(cs_bucket_demean(cross_mean(day_gini(Ret), 30), cross_mean(day_sum(Amt), 30)), LogFloatCap)`  — F113 升级版原样(减同成交额档均值)再放到市值档内排名:成交额和市值都近似拿掉,是 b_f113_in_size 的下界。预期买低,净超额 +3~+6%;若两条相差 3 个点以上,差的那部分是档内换手率。

